OL,3,GNEWSABuilding collapses after van
OL,4,Asmashes into it
OL,5,
OL,6,FA building has collapsed after a van
OL,7,Fcrashed into it in the early hours of
OL,8,FMonday morning, police said.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,11,Fthe van smashed into the building in St
OL,12,FHelens Road, Bolton - believed to be an
OL,13,Festate agents - just after 02:00 BST.
OL,15,FGMP said a man, in his 30s, had been
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of drink driving
OL,17,Fafter he failed to provide a breath
OL,18,Fspecimen. The road has been closed.
